WEBVTT

00:03.550 --> 00:06.120
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.300 --> 00:10.230
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.240 --> 00:13.830
What he is?

00:14.020 --> 00:18.410
What he wants?

00:22.080 --> 00:29.490
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.490 --> 00:34.560
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:36.840 --> 00:43.820
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.240 --> 00:51.690
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.490 --> 00:56.980
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.200 --> 01:00.490
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:00.840 --> 01:04.340
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.560 --> 01:07.920
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.220 --> 01:11.750
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:11.950 --> 01:15.300
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.620 --> 01:19.140
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.140 --> 01:24.050
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.810 --> 01:35.360
Robot Circus

01:40.370 --> 01:44.220
You never take a vacation
unless someone forces you to.

01:44.270 --> 01:48.370
So I'm making you take a vacation
at a hot spring this weekend.

01:54.870 --> 01:58.560
Once we get there, Atom, I want you
to keep an eye on him and make sure he rests.

01:58.560 --> 01:59.520
Sure.

01:59.870 --> 02:02.600
That is the town of Bella Notte.

02:07.450 --> 02:10.160
What are those tents?

02:16.920 --> 02:19.530
Could it be the honorable director?

02:21.560 --> 02:24.870
Welcome to Bella Notte!

02:24.970 --> 02:28.920
I'm Mayor Coward.

02:29.250 --> 02:31.230
Thank you.

02:31.420 --> 02:34.690
Aren't the flowers beautiful?

02:34.880 --> 02:38.390
Dr. Ochanomizu,
the Robot Circus is in town.

02:38.410 --> 02:41.100
What? Robot Circus?

02:41.150 --> 02:42.890
Oh, yes...

02:42.950 --> 02:45.100
...they are a traveling circus...

02:45.100 --> 02:48.150
...and they're very popular
in Bella Notte.

02:48.200 --> 02:50.620
They are fantastic!

02:50.620 --> 02:52.420
Hey, Coward!

02:52.530 --> 02:56.950
When did you become the PR
representative for the Robot Circus?

02:56.950 --> 02:59.090
Gustaf.

02:59.730 --> 03:00.900
Get in!

03:00.970 --> 03:03.950
Yes, sir.
See you later.

03:05.640 --> 03:11.210
The newest robots look
just like humans.

03:11.680 --> 03:13.340
I don't like it!

03:19.960 --> 03:21.440
Who is that guy?

03:21.440 --> 03:23.180
He is Mr. Gustaf.

03:23.330 --> 03:26.980
He runs the town.

03:31.100 --> 03:36.440
Listen, Bella Notte is
an old-fashioned town.

03:36.540 --> 03:42.540
We like good old values. The robots
have always been our servants.

03:42.590 --> 03:47.510
We should never spoil these
lowly machines.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.820
Don't forget that.

03:48.820 --> 03:49.850
Yes, sir.

03:50.000 --> 03:53.410
Right. We must keep
the robots in their place.

03:56.820 --> 03:58.860
Ladies and gentlemen,
boys and girls.

03:59.030 --> 04:02.860
We welcome you to the Robot Circus.

04:03.020 --> 04:05.280
The show is about to begin.

04:25.920 --> 04:30.500
I thought he hated the Robot Circus.
Why is he here?

04:50.300 --> 04:53.640
Everyone, calm down.
Please exit this way.

04:57.530 --> 04:58.810
Cookie!

05:01.560 --> 05:03.410
Bonbon, get me up there!

05:03.410 --> 05:04.560
Sure!

05:08.360 --> 05:09.810
Be careful, Reno!

05:09.810 --> 05:11.060
I'll be okay.

05:24.380 --> 05:25.670
Are you okay?

05:25.670 --> 05:27.310
Cookie, are you okay?

05:28.780 --> 05:29.910
Thanks.

05:33.550 --> 05:34.510
Atom!

05:34.620 --> 05:36.310
Are you all right, Atom?

05:36.540 --> 05:39.500
Dr. Ochanomizu, he is a human.

05:39.590 --> 05:40.820
What?

05:41.700 --> 05:44.850
Atom is a hero. He saved all of us.

05:44.880 --> 05:50.670
Atom says one of Gustaf's men
cut the rope.

05:50.670 --> 05:52.900
Okay, you are all fixed now!

05:54.600 --> 05:55.830
Try moving all your parts.

05:55.830 --> 05:59.470
Wow, you can fix anything!
Perfect!

06:00.680 --> 06:03.290
Is he fixed already?

06:03.350 --> 06:04.380
Yes.

06:05.870 --> 06:09.280
What is this, a memory unit?

06:09.280 --> 06:11.720
You can have it if you want.

06:11.790 --> 06:14.260
Reno made that.

06:14.730 --> 06:17.100
Reno is so smart.

06:17.600 --> 06:22.720
Unbelievable!
You have a great engineering mind.

06:22.740 --> 06:24.620
Do you really think so?

06:24.690 --> 06:28.400
Yes, but you'll need proper training.

06:28.440 --> 06:30.890
You're giving me too much credit.

06:31.430 --> 06:35.920
Because I'm a robot,
I can fix robots.

06:35.940 --> 06:39.970
Why are you pretending
to be a robot?

06:44.470 --> 06:46.260
You are a human.

06:46.300 --> 06:51.630
What are you saying?
I'm a robot. Don't be ridiculous!

06:51.650 --> 06:54.980
Right! Don't be crazy!
Reno is a robot!

06:54.980 --> 06:56.360
Get out of here!

06:56.380 --> 06:57.320
Get out of here!

06:57.320 --> 06:58.360
Get out!

06:58.360 --> 06:59.610
Stop it!

06:59.710 --> 07:02.710
They helped us!

07:03.280 --> 07:06.980
I'm sorry, but it might be better
if you left now.

07:07.480 --> 07:10.490
We're a traveling circus...

07:10.490 --> 07:13.380
...and we can't afford to cause
any problems in this town.

07:16.760 --> 07:18.570
Thank you very much.

07:20.260 --> 07:21.120
Reno!

07:22.100 --> 07:23.980
Aren't you Reno?

07:26.330 --> 07:27.990
I'm sorry about what happened
earlier today.

07:28.170 --> 07:32.200
I didn't mean to offend you
and your friends.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.790
Hey, Atom.

07:44.790 --> 07:45.890
What?

07:46.450 --> 07:52.260
I was abandoned as a baby.
The circus people took me in.

07:52.260 --> 07:55.140
So they raised you?

07:55.180 --> 07:56.040
Right.

07:56.300 --> 07:59.780
When I was little,
I thought Cupcake was my mother...

07:59.800 --> 08:04.660
and that I had five fathers. And my
number-one father was the ringmaster.

08:04.700 --> 08:06.730
That's amazing.

08:09.340 --> 08:11.400
That's where I live now.

08:13.750 --> 08:16.860
We've traveled to so many
different places together.

08:17.650 --> 08:20.720
You know, we are a family.

08:20.850 --> 08:22.170
A family?

08:22.680 --> 08:26.790
I know they are all robots
and I'm a human...

08:27.160 --> 08:31.330
...but we care about each other
more than anything.

08:31.830 --> 08:34.550
If the humans find out
that I'm not a robot...

08:34.800 --> 08:38.330
...they'll take me away
because I'm still a boy.

08:38.330 --> 08:40.330
I won't tell anyone.

08:40.770 --> 08:44.510
I won't tell anyone that
you are a human.

08:45.580 --> 08:47.770
Thanks, Atom.

08:56.090 --> 08:59.510
Check their background completely!

08:59.530 --> 09:01.280
Get something on them!

09:01.290 --> 09:03.450
Get something..

09:03.450 --> 09:04.730
Yes, sir!

09:06.800 --> 09:08.900
That's not good.

09:11.540 --> 09:13.590
Are you sure that's what
Gustaf is doing?

09:13.840 --> 09:17.340
They'll find out about Reno
in no time!

09:17.400 --> 09:19.880
Ringmaster, let's get out of town now!

09:19.880 --> 09:22.680
Otherwise they'll catch us.

09:28.190 --> 09:31.770
What should we do with that boy?

09:32.840 --> 09:34.530
Ringmaster.

09:35.330 --> 09:37.310
Dr. Ochanomizu, could you
do me a favor?

09:37.630 --> 09:40.920
Coward!
Get the police after them!

09:41.060 --> 09:43.650
Arrest all the circus robots!

09:43.650 --> 09:45.410
What?

09:45.640 --> 09:50.420
Bundt, the owner of the Robot Circus
died a long time ago

09:50.740 --> 09:54.720
...and their registration
has been cancelled.

09:54.810 --> 09:56.460
Are you sure?

09:56.540 --> 10:00.560
Those robots should have been
destroyed a long time ago.

10:00.560 --> 10:03.940
And they're traveling
with a human child.

10:07.860 --> 10:11.880
So I should deliver this letter
to Dr. Ochanomizu at the hotel?

10:11.880 --> 10:15.590
Right, make sure he gets it.

10:15.670 --> 10:16.760
Okay!

10:21.050 --> 10:22.240
Reno.

10:22.740 --> 10:23.860
Ringmaster.

10:23.860 --> 10:26.120
Okay, let's get out of town!

10:26.180 --> 10:27.720
Hurry up!

10:35.260 --> 10:36.990
Sorry, Reno.

10:37.260 --> 10:40.380
Dr. Ochanomizu just left.

10:41.030 --> 10:43.140
Okay, then I'll wait until
he comes back.

10:47.130 --> 10:48.940
They're heading towards the tent!

10:48.940 --> 10:50.630
They must have found out!

10:54.770 --> 10:57.650
Everyone,
this is the poor child...

10:57.650 --> 11:01.060
who was kidnapped by the robots.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.380
Don't touch me!

11:04.320 --> 11:08.210
That's right.
They kidnapped him...

11:08.210 --> 11:11.460
...and made him perform
in their circus.

11:13.060 --> 11:16.170
What did you say?
Is that true?

11:16.560 --> 11:19.730
No, Reno! There's no use.
They won't believe you.

11:19.800 --> 11:24.850
Everyone, as soon as the robots
are arrested they'll be destroyed

11:24.850 --> 11:28.360
and the city will take care of the boy.
Isn't that right, mayor?

11:28.420 --> 11:30.760
Well....

11:30.810 --> 11:32.070
Mayor!

11:32.410 --> 11:34.420
Now, come with me!

11:34.420 --> 11:35.540
Don't!

11:35.780 --> 11:41.620
Hey, robot!
Are you going to hurt a human?

11:42.390 --> 11:43.960
Let's go!

11:43.960 --> 11:46.350
Let him go!

11:46.730 --> 11:49.660
I'm his guardian.

11:49.710 --> 11:50.860
Dr. Ochanomizu!

11:51.530 --> 11:54.550
I just signed the paperwork
to become his guardian.

11:56.540 --> 12:00.760
Whatever happens in this town
falls under the authority of the police.

12:00.860 --> 12:04.710
You can't interfere with what we do
with the robots.

12:07.750 --> 12:10.670
Dr. Ochanomizu, I'm going
to the circus.

12:10.680 --> 12:13.530
Are you going to fight the police?

12:14.420 --> 12:15.790
Don't worry.

12:15.990 --> 12:18.490
We can take care of ourselves.

12:18.520 --> 12:19.410
Reno!

12:20.290 --> 12:22.650
As I said,
I am your guardian now.

12:23.030 --> 12:26.620
Listen,
the ringmaster left you with me.

12:26.690 --> 12:31.600
He wants you to go with me to the city
so you can study robot engineering.

12:31.660 --> 12:35.470
What are you saying?
They wouldn't leave me.

12:35.710 --> 12:38.390
You have a letter from
the ringmaster, right?

12:38.480 --> 12:41.510
It's for you.

12:41.950 --> 12:45.370
They should still be around here.
Find them!

12:45.590 --> 12:48.050
Reno, I'm sorry that we lied to you.

12:48.490 --> 12:51.570
Our registration has been cancelled.

12:51.930 --> 12:55.180
All we can do now is save ourselves.

12:55.360 --> 13:00.490
We can no longer travel with you.
You're a human...

13:00.540 --> 13:03.710
...and that just brings us trouble.

13:11.140 --> 13:15.430
Because I'm not a robot,
they say I bring them trouble.

13:15.520 --> 13:16.830
Shoot.

13:19.220 --> 13:20.660
That is very cruel!

13:20.850 --> 13:24.750
Reno always thought of the
circus robots as his family.

13:24.790 --> 13:26.480
That's why.

13:26.480 --> 13:27.370
What?

13:27.410 --> 13:30.200
It's because they are his family
that they're doing this.

13:43.780 --> 13:45.570
There's no way for us to escape now.

13:46.150 --> 13:49.580
We did our best.
We saved Reno.

13:49.640 --> 13:54.890
We had to tell him he was the problem
or else he would have tried to come along.

13:56.640 --> 14:00.020
Reno will make a great robot scientist.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.660
That's what we wanted for him.

14:05.900 --> 14:07.030
Ringmaster?

14:07.120 --> 14:07.930
The police must be here.

14:07.930 --> 14:09.490
Mr. Pannacotta!

14:09.840 --> 14:10.670
Atom.

14:10.970 --> 14:13.830
We have to go now. Grab onto me.

14:13.830 --> 14:15.980
Does Dr. Ochanomizu
know you're here?

14:16.110 --> 14:17.470
Yes, he does.

14:41.130 --> 14:43.040
That's an electromagnetic ray gun!

14:43.040 --> 14:44.170
This way!

14:49.970 --> 14:51.420
There they are!

14:51.420 --> 14:52.660
This way!

14:53.150 --> 14:54.450
Mr. Pannacotta!

15:18.440 --> 15:19.680
Atom!

15:27.480 --> 15:28.390
What on Earth happened?

15:28.390 --> 15:30.040
What's going on?

15:30.080 --> 15:33.080
The kidnapper robots
are hiding in there.

15:33.160 --> 15:37.150
They've caused so much trouble.
They're not getting away this time.

15:40.030 --> 15:41.960
Atom, are you all right?

15:43.400 --> 15:45.150
Yes, I'm all right now.

15:45.150 --> 15:46.250
Good.

15:47.670 --> 15:52.280
Atom, we're going to end this
in our own way.

15:54.170 --> 15:56.120
Hey, they're coming out!

16:04.280 --> 16:06.110
What is he trying to do?

16:07.240 --> 16:11.160
This will be our last show.

16:19.330 --> 16:22.230
What are you doing?
Shoot them!

16:22.230 --> 16:24.890
But they aren't running away anymore.

16:24.890 --> 16:26.270
What?

16:26.840 --> 16:30.140
Please enjoy our show!

16:34.320 --> 16:35.230
Atom.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.910
Mr. Pannacotta.

16:42.950 --> 16:47.650
Our first act is the jewel
of our show, Cupcake.

16:56.870 --> 16:58.160
Cupcake.

16:59.070 --> 17:03.480
It's been 1 1 years
since I first met Reno.

17:05.380 --> 17:07.390
What are we going to do now?

17:07.460 --> 17:11.460
Mr. Bundt is not here
to look after us anymore.

17:11.520 --> 17:15.390
Maybe we would have been better off
if we had been destroyed.

17:25.530 --> 17:26.800
It's a baby.

17:26.850 --> 17:29.380
Don't cry. Don't cry.

17:32.420 --> 17:34.680
Look, he is laughing.

17:37.680 --> 17:40.360
Hey, he's hungry!

17:40.450 --> 17:41.810
He needs a change of clothes.

17:41.920 --> 17:44.240
He needs a place to live too!

17:44.240 --> 17:46.180
But how?

17:46.220 --> 17:49.010
Cookie, we are circus robots.

17:49.620 --> 17:50.420
Right?

17:50.530 --> 17:51.230
Right.

18:02.140 --> 18:06.060
Right. We're circus robots.

18:10.370 --> 18:11.670
And....

18:17.520 --> 18:18.850
Cookie.

18:19.320 --> 18:23.140
Reno, you were our hope.

18:23.590 --> 18:26.170
Are you ready, Reno?

18:26.170 --> 18:26.870
Sure!

18:26.960 --> 18:28.770
Now open your eyes.

18:34.900 --> 18:37.960
Right, it's because of Reno--

18:38.100 --> 18:40.670
That we started the circus
back up again.

18:44.080 --> 18:45.270
Bonbon.

18:52.090 --> 18:53.650
Jellybean.

18:59.020 --> 19:00.220
Marshmallow.

19:01.160 --> 19:03.750
We had a lot of fun together, Reno.

19:26.820 --> 19:28.160
This will warm you up.

19:31.880 --> 19:34.420
Ringmaster, you....

19:35.670 --> 19:39.220
You guys took
very good care of me.

19:57.280 --> 19:58.300
You guys!

19:59.350 --> 20:00.370
Stay away!

20:02.120 --> 20:04.820
Reno, you're talented.

20:05.150 --> 20:10.040
You have to live the rest of your life
as a human, not a robot.

20:10.360 --> 20:12.540
That's why you wrote that letter.

20:12.570 --> 20:16.210
Go on! Be a good human.

20:19.890 --> 20:22.750
What are you doing?
Catch them!

20:22.750 --> 20:24.260
Please don't!

20:25.550 --> 20:26.680
Everyone,

20:26.700 --> 20:29.240
it's not true that the robots
kidnapped the boy.

20:29.240 --> 20:31.450
Gustaf made it up!

20:32.100 --> 20:34.160
Coward!

20:34.710 --> 20:36.220
You scumbag!

20:36.490 --> 20:38.820
I've had enough of you!

20:38.890 --> 20:43.380
Everyone, I'd like to register them
as the circus of Bella Notte...

20:43.430 --> 20:48.080
...and welcome them here!

21:03.080 --> 21:03.930
Reno!

21:09.160 --> 21:12.460
Dr. Ochanomizu,
I'll go to the city with you.

21:12.930 --> 21:14.180
Really?

21:14.360 --> 21:15.220
Yes.

21:18.560 --> 21:21.500
Don't you have to see them
before you go?

21:21.550 --> 21:25.290
That's okay.
I've decided I won't see them...

21:25.300 --> 21:28.640
until I become a successful scientist.
I'll surprise them.

21:34.690 --> 21:39.000
I wonder if he saw the special
fireworks we set off for him.

21:39.050 --> 21:40.850
He knows.

21:41.060 --> 21:42.940
He knows how we feel.

21:43.560 --> 21:46.910
Even if we aren't together,
we're still a family.

21:47.390 --> 21:49.420
Now, let's start the show!

21:49.420 --> 21:50.660
Let's!

21:52.930 --> 21:54.940
The circus is about to get started.

21:55.000 --> 21:57.350
Right.

21:58.040 --> 21:59.640
So is my new life.

22:12.000 --> 22:17.530
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.930 --> 22:23.140
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.520 --> 22:29.030
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.310 --> 22:34.610
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:34.970 --> 22:40.250
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.730 --> 22:48.890
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.290 --> 22:52.170
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.380 --> 23:00.380
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:00.970 --> 23:03.380
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.810 --> 23:12.090
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.390 --> 23:17.120
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:24.090 --> 23:25.830
Skunk is finally arrested

23:25.880 --> 23:28.490
and taken to the high-security
prison Chroizier.

23:28.650 --> 23:31.980
But it seems like he's planning
something!

23:32.260 --> 23:34.950
Next time :
Resurrected Jumbo.

23:35.110 --> 23:37.740
With your heart, catch the future!
